# Clash/Mihomo TUN uses 198.18.0.0/15 as a synthetic DNS answer range. Keep
# the public-network SSRF policy strict by allowing that range only when the
# dsh launcher explicitly opts in, and only for hostnames (never IP literals).

--- a/packages/web/web-fetch-http/src/network.ts
+++ b/packages/web/web-fetch-http/src/network.ts
